{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:69b0d06325a71ae2cced4e576304523e23e387884ac1478ec6c58c3a59707cec",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e9e420cecfc139e01a1d218c63a01c75234efdb0173fcd7854c2b53a755f2d2",
      "text": "一如往常、又胜过往常的快乐夜晚",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccd03962a9ae4ca94390df6bbd6ca7c0eebce52f2ccab059eb868fc9fa3e4010",
      "text": "S.E.M聚集在次郎家。类提议在道夫生日\n那天去吃晚餐。作为生日的筹备，\n类负责调查道夫想吃什么，次郎负责选店，\n大家分头展开了准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000019:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000019:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e9e420cecfc139e01a1d218c63a01c75234efdb0173fcd7854c2b53a755f2d2",
      "text": "一如往常、又胜过往常的快乐夜晚",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128ba3253b56eedfd92fd27247193a4a53de3e5a1bbed1709539db08438162b1",
      "text": "次郎的家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9d918b1157eb9851e6f34b6b115e1e23b60146f66d2ae2889580f3b68e727c9",
      "text": "硲先生，生日那天有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3672cc7d7976a78f5d6ebeee7e926cd911d54c6db2db77b891a578af54f2990e",
      "text": "我的生日吗？我确认一下日程。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ddbcb1635dfe01ef6277c1f62d0be07553c0743a60248e67eb9e99d6f75bf46",
      "text": "……目前没有任何安排。\n顶多是家里可能会打电话过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6578d8732e160930e3250832f3153259f3329b9257f8418bde81fbd2d1d8fb75",
      "text": "既然这样，那就趁今天聚在一起的机会，\n去吃生日dinner吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef6ac35b591c73af3be918c595d08f0ec7e1587835a32ae291cd46e35b6fcd63",
      "text": "哎，虽然也不限于生日那天，\n反正平时也总一起吃就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6370929a6e6e3aaa1565e329a08f197a646af141a1f2847355be61a922a16c59",
      "text": "这次就由我们来请客吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:559857f66a7cdc73d4230013bdd5b26cbccdab9695a9bfecefadde615dc9d3ae",
      "text": "真是令人高兴的提议。\n去吃饭的话，把制作人也叫来可以吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47780bde9244841bb447714868cd92ea72f1eeab95899ac62a1d665d2172cfb6",
      "text": "Of course！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de8042a008851f73a5459ecec6015329e257dfc24a2cc183f1b288804d9d17d0",
      "text": "订位子还有协调日程之类的事，\n我和类两个人搞定就行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_a:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99404465fdb7d54f07a6ff97e8e6c918acf7f0186b09e1cb18ae67afb2204569",
      "text": "好。拜托你们了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_b:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "次日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c40f9639da62f5966aab32c17d84730dc43698b0bbc6bb292395eb4a0e89386",
      "text": "……事情就是这样，制作人酱也\n一定要来birthday dinner哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31ee59923e50835a016081973f4cf0e1fb0a98c707c17918688f38ea542061e3",
      "text": "当然方便的话最好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d54f2dbd7db23882d1d70c7312c84cc8b6c664907edebd03fa3f4418c1e6461",
      "text": "好的！\n请务必让我参加。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7969ce0d0630237821363236d4f242200ebe4c8994fe18f9194744d5339d163b",
      "text": "谢谢。\n硲先生也会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:598b21a69ddf6d6db619b5ffdc89761248704d168bdd2ecb6815fffe4a8a1710",
      "text": "接下来就得定去哪儿了。\n你们两个，要是有什么好店就告诉我啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9494cd642fa1338b5b333f87be94fe030cd5687fd8b97bea54b650cbacaa95a9",
      "text": "OK！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c98c95d7f5d73f62da82b31b3f417c64c4c6cd60ac540d4a393167d901567d95",
      "text": "好的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a5aef327233e98b2bc072421ae979a18db42211a14c457a668deb7a2e787828",
      "text": "Mr. 山下，感觉挺有干劲的嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4a4ada77241d07e0a2ff09792ed3038573e69e9e4d76548e52c2ae2672195345",
      "text": "哈哈……哎，偶尔大叔我也得\n正经表现一下嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c4098b6d48ebf2451cba4bb86e5c47752b3e30c87b18da9a37b1632a1a14959",
      "text": "类。能不能去问问硲先生，\n有没有什么特别想吃的东西？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_b:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:757cfff2839e6e42c416c342db53a5c34c76caa5a7784b72e22be845eb87fc07",
      "text": "嗯，包在我身上☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_c:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21f466959b384a6122bfb71493baa3fc3836b36ad31ffca7b7eda120ee873b3c",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1b97fb60dc5881d1db97f6a0a6df9d9383140ff42a0e646aaddcf0986dcab27",
      "text": "辛苦了，道夫先生。\n您到得真早呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a338db54a4c039e683fab5ca5987f1bdc73cd95b6693108e8a083e40ec95bd42",
      "text": "嗯。前面的安排提前结束了。\n等舞田君和山下君到吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faefd3393970898a183caa58595c7d56f8efaa1d87555b1ac1d94ea5902a8adf",
      "text": "……舞田君发LINK来了。失陪一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72b2e9ac7a756b9f8dda7f5ca2a7c28e4917b26d55b62f6a8bb93bef61a58274",
      "text": "“Mr. 硲，有什么想吃的东西吗？”\n……他是这么说的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c1d781004878a87c5d71439e44d2ac7043bc7929489dc09930f3a813ddb4e50",
      "text": "这是在问我现在想吃什么吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:312f67323c924b247943e0d67811144ac744486bd1bda74241d24bb9f60978ab",
      "text": "应该是在挑聚餐的店吧？\n前几天他们聊过这个呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b0ef08453eb6f14362cdef96cd4e22f05630f6253790b07db6faa25ccbea809",
      "text": "原来如此。是作为聚餐的参考啊。\n我马上回复舞田君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13df774cd32cac445eb9175c6b8f06fe8fa0fa07bc7281741b1c5ad3f34681f2",
      "text": "说起来，听说制作人也\n会来参加呢。我听山下君说了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9540e02b9b818309c28b3fdf7e14e097456b91484db1e73b1815f732f21c16b",
      "text": "百忙之中抽空过来，非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3988f39af101a46cda7c34393ff49d23d7ddcbba4af57af53f798e76c691c12e",
      "text": "我问过Mr. 硲想吃什么了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bdfaff5cf74d55c7062f67ae3ce88a2647defd086f009b34a4efee4a200f2ab6",
      "text": "他说交由我们的choice决定。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cf175fc136507a291a64fa9de28e9034c706969dfbfb7e0ebd102bb42d33182",
      "text": "这样啊。谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:805b496457896d25397dcb0560dd1caf8057cd75d51671ec1f526a3ad6f4c979",
      "text": "那就，\n选大叔我推荐的居酒屋吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:877517a175c09cc0cc92729001f0916860f632b120caf8fcae0f2d8cef550571",
      "text": "是一家生鱼片特别好吃的宝藏小店哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29abd20a0a96b5bff8d73850d08afffb0f1d5d28d719c19618a55abae4e05732",
      "text": "Great！\nMr. 硲肯定也会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7eeef6c06b69c7d61ed2eaa83110e449279c801ba28a438c293c9654ff6903f",
      "text": "我今天去买present！\n这边就交给我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8f4d4a332c41a6d36ede2a4fabd3b3fb3240370f3bdc06babea0f8e0233756e",
      "text": "噢，挺好的嘛。\n很期待类会选什么呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7ceaf0f12af082ce718ff3019cfc078690bd5463c4d6ebf0c340b606224781c",
      "text": "OK！\n去给Mr. 硲一个惊喜吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31228971c51cec2706ab9c3d707c86cc5472f91028e58546661b07352ff02a94",
      "text": "Mr. 硲，happy birthday♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a37e55a2cf593e8bf13b49c4209fcc69fb0f6fc2ce0c4b33c9afd0c800064fa",
      "text": "那么，干杯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53cf84291d34f06a7f90aef3c7032605864e05d5e25bcfc46fbc0b7afb3996bc",
      "text": "祝您生日快乐，硲先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c55ceea085bb467ac9e7d545a837447033aa63b4fee08b57fb3b10391a8b6e77",
      "text": "道夫先生，祝您生日快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee97fcd3497c0e23cc82b89b1bd8b05a2016cb84ac3c39e8c3023921463c3f0e",
      "text": "谢谢你们三位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78175c545806d3ca0e3f487f895e0b0459f1e5be1cf599c18dbf3384ad4ea503",
      "text": "哈——，果然第一杯还得是啤酒啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ba5bb83bab7616d36f754b96e50c542c747555ea43ca867c7aca358c1d919aa",
      "text": "啊！Mr. 硲，mustache！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5886032460a695aa3644f1b8a0183b2d7585b73491dc7548579e7abd51209548",
      "text": "小胡子？\n啊，是啤酒泡沫啊。谢谢你，舞田君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f7d669b215d4f4d99272deee585c98b3d3700c98c63ef42f0fbdcf9cee6afbf",
      "text": "……这里是家很不错的店呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbe3143d77bf5b844bd9e6ae4896b0a6c9b8f83e3c1af854bf76e91bdabf8579",
      "text": "再次感谢你们为了我的生日所做的一切安排。\n方方面面，想必都很不容易吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8a483dd33882d8f8b44c44694d0ce1e8cecabc3b8f1f8bc5d8421d3964b756d",
      "text": "我筹备的时候也超开心的哦。\n你们两位也是吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7",
      "text": "是的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd71154708bd14529a5632014955b7748f3eea49d7ddd3918b1433116a2eccde",
      "text": "好啦好啦，别那么拘谨了，\n今天就好好享受吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e495767970e915beb07351ddd54e12c650c1da40f0066c289184e38ccdb75b5",
      "text": "腌乌贼内脏拌土豆黄油、毛豆……然后，\n最后是这个。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef94e80b9e581e06d7a10808cc2273ddfb55ee6969d89ff0e410b415aef420fa",
      "text": "Wow！超级big的刺身拼盘船呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:758925ea366b2357d67128568e870e473477420c7c8c26cfb2d61c7a99169c9e",
      "text": "这可真是……气派啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00a043e9320eb454610e001480aeda6e1780df28a79d670d122c05067579e0e2",
      "text": "对了。吃之前拍张纪念照吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c36bd947aea1bfcd559f1b5646ebe015fa0efb34dc89c32cd3d7de769d26b5c",
      "text": "那我来拍吧。各位，\n能靠拢一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000200:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4e740ff0c914d068f1629bc2ce75873beb8ddd7d05d66edf07addddc53c1ad9",
      "text": "好嘞好嘞。\n那硲先生站中间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000205:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ea2f09652bf7b3a07b2a341e114e84d48acc929a1fcf447f2d338e57b749ccd",
      "text": "好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000210:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c4ee513caa607d6f406a5790f6c4bb4387dcd1efd64ce94b2fc6ef011b6605b",
      "text": "要拍了哦。1+1等于？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_035mco_02_1_2_035_02:1_2_035_02_e:cmd-000239:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9596c0ae9f520158bb023d8488c4b0e47862ea6c7bfce39065675bacea86a31f",
      "text": "2！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
